.vercel

# Build output. `npm run build` writes the web bundle to dist/, and
# `npm run build:native` writes the app that ships in the APK to native/www/
# (which is what capacitor.config.ts points webDir at). Both are generated —
# run the build rather than committing the result; the asset filenames are
# content-hashed and churn on every build.
dist/
native/www/
